.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt IRQ_ACK 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm irq_ack
.Nd acknowledge a device interrupt
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn irq_ack irq
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm re-enables a level-triggered
.Dv LEGACY
line after the driver has acknowledged the interrupt at the device.
The line is also unmasked on the first
.Nm
before any interrupt fired.
For MSI/MSI-X the call does nothing: edge-triggered messages never need a
re-arm.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EBADF
.Fa irq
is not an interrupt handle.
.It Er EACCES
The handle lacks the
.Dv READ
right.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
